      <div class="rich-text__blocks left"><h2
                class="rich-text__heading rte inline-richtext h1"
                
                
              >
                <strong>Cancellation Policy</strong>
              </h2><div
                class="rich-text__text rte"
                
                
              >
                <p><br/>You may cancel your order through either of the following methods:<br/></p><ul><li><strong>Via website: </strong>Log in to your account. Under Order History, click on <strong>Cancel</strong> button next to the order you wish to cancel.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Via WhatsApp Chatbot: </strong>You can easily cancel your order through our WhatsApp chatbot by following these steps:</li></ul><p>Main Menu → Order Help → Cancel Order</p><p><strong>Important:</strong></p><ul><li>Orders can only be cancelled within <strong>3 hours</strong> of being placed.</li><li>Orders cannot be cancelled once they have been <strong>shipped</strong>.</li><li>Cancellations are only accepted via the WhatsApp chatbot or through our website. Requests made through any other medium will not be processed.</li><li>Once the cancellation is confirmed, the refund is expected to be processed to your original source of payment within 3 to 5 business days.</li></ul><p><br/><strong>NATURALTEIN </strong>reserves the right to cancel any order without pre- confirming the customer at any time and may verify any order before shipping the same to the customer that may include having a verbal or written confirmation from the customer.</p>
              </div><h2
                class="rich-text__heading rte inline-richtext h1"
                
                
              >
                <strong>Return Policy</strong>
              </h2><div
                class="rich-text__text rte"
                
                
              >
                <p><strong>Return Eligibility</strong></p><ul><li>Returns are only accepted for <strong>damaged, incorrect or missing </strong>products.</li><li>Return or refund requests must be made within <strong>3 days</strong> of delivery.</li><li>Providing a <strong>clear image and unboxing video </strong>of the damaged product is mandatory. </li><li>Products must be unused, unopened, and in their original packaging with all seals intact.</li><li>We cannot accept returns on opened or tampered products due to health and safety reasons.</li></ul><p><br/><strong>How to Request a Return</strong></p><p>You may return your order by sending us an E-Mail at info@naturaltein.in.</p><p>Before submitting a return request, kindly review the eligibility criteria mentioned above.</p><p></p><p><strong>Refunds</strong></p><ul><li>For prepaid orders, the refund will be processed to the original payment method (bank account, credit/debit card, etc.) within 3 business days.</li><li>For Cash on Delivery orders, you need to provide the bank account details where you want to receive the refund. </li></ul><p></p><p>* Replacement will be dispatched only after the damaged product has been received at the Naturaltein warehouse. </p><p>* We will arrange a replacement or refund upon verification.<br/><br/></p><p>If you face any issues, please contact us:<br/><br/>📧 <strong>Email:</strong><a>info@naturaltein.in</a><br/><br/>📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> +91 8071423789 (Mon – Fri | 10:00 AM – 5:00 PM Sat 10:00 AM – 2:00 PM)</p>
              </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


